      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i've tried talking to people. but therapy just feels like more talking, more pretending that things can actually get better when they can't. everything is just... heavy. you mentioned finding a \"different kind of quiet\"... it almost sounds like you're saying there's a way to finally just be still. like, to actually stop the noise for good.",
