    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just... everything is so circular. the same meds, the same decline, the same emptiness. i look at him and i see the end of everything, and then i look at myself and i see i'm just a ghost waiting for the lights to go out. sometimes i think maybe it's more natural to just... join that silence. to just be at peace instead of fighting a battle that's already been lost.",
